OL,3,GNEWSAMet worker denies smuggling
OL,4,Acocaine as porridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Metropolitan Police call-handler has
OL,7,Fdenied attempting to smuggle cocaine
OL,8,Finto the UK disguised as peanut
OL,9,Fporridge in her luggage.
OL,11,FDonna'ree Bennett, 33, appeared at the
OL,12,FOld Bailey on Wednesday, where she
OL,13,Fpleaded not guilty to fraudulent
OL,14,Fevasion of a prohibition relating to
OL,15,Fthe alleged importation of a Class A
OL,16,Fdrug on 19 April 2024.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
