OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet worker denies smuggling
OL,4,Acocaine as porridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe also pleaded not guilty to two
OL,7,Fcharges of transferring and possessing
OL,8,Fcriminal property alleged to represent
OL,9,Fthe proceeds of crime between 1
OL,10,FNovember 2022 and 31 January 2024. The
OL,11,Fcase followed an Independent Office for
OL,12,FPolice Conduct investigation.
OL,14,FA trial was set for 23 August next year
OL,15,Fand Bennett, of Hackney, was granted
OL,16,Funconditional bail.
